# Every /honest-paywall board, one launch each so state never carries over
# between them. Each deep link's DebugQA scenario calls completeOnboarding()
# itself (Services/DebugQA.swift), so no /plus-home landing step is needed
# first — @AppStorage(OnboardingFlow.stepStorageKey) in ContentView.swift:11
# observes the UserDefaults write and switches straight to MainTabView.
# Never tap a purchase CTA (paywall.action.upgrade, "Get Pillie Plus") or a
# restore control.

launch
wait text Today 15  # the link rebuilds Home, then posts; an early post is lost
openurl pillie://debug/honest-paywall?board=duringTrial&lang=en
wait text "You still have Pillie Plus." 10
# paywall.story.trial_active.title (en), Commerce.xcstrings.
# HonestPaywallStoryFactory.swift duringTrial(...). PillieApp.swift case
# "/honest-paywall" -> "duringTrial": DebugQA.apply(.trialActive) then posts
# .pillieDebugPresentHonestPaywall(object: "duringTrial"), observed by
# HomeView.swift:644-654, which sets showTrialKeepPlusPaywall = true.
shot paywall-during-trial
tap --id xmark --element-type Button  # paywall close; a review-prompt "Close" can sit behind it
# HonestPaywallBoard.chrome for .duringTrial has showsClose: true.
# HonestPaywallBoard.swift:26-31. Close's accessibilityLabel is
# global.action.close -> "Close". HonestPaywallView.swift:46-63.

# settingsFree is not driven here: its link applies existingUserTrialAnnouncement,
# whose one-shot announcement sheet blocks the paywall cover (PillieApp.swift
# /honest-paywall, HomeView.swift onReceive). Reach it from Settings > Pillie
# Plus on a free user instead. See features/paywalls.md.
# .settingsFree chrome also has showsClose: true. HonestPaywallBoard.swift
# :26-31.

launch
wait text Today 15  # the link rebuilds Home, then posts; an early post is lost
openurl pillie://debug/honest-paywall?board=trialEndedReturningLegacy&lang=en
wait text "Welcome back." 10
# paywall.story.trial_ended.returning.legacy.title (en). PillieApp.swift
# case "trialEndedReturningLegacy": DebugQA.apply
# (.trialExpiredGrandfatherReturning) -> applyExpiredPaywall(...,
# pack: .freshReinstall()), which completes onboarding and clears the
# one-shot auto-present flag (DebugQA.swift:311-327), so HomeView's
# autoPresentTrialEndPaywallIfNeeded (HomeView.swift:180-201,511) presents it
# once Home appears.
shot paywall-trial-ended-legacy
tap --id xmark --element-type Button  # paywall close; a review-prompt "Close" can sit behind it
# terms .legacy -> HonestPaywallChrome(showsClose: true,
# allowsInteractiveDismiss: true, showsContinueFree: true).
# HonestPaywallStoryFactory.swift chrome(for:).

launch
wait text Today 15  # the link rebuilds Home, then posts; an early post is lost
openurl pillie://debug/honest-paywall?board=trialEndedReturningHard&lang=en
wait text "Your trial has ended." 10
# paywall.story.trial_ended.returning.hard.title (en). PillieApp.swift case
# "trialEndedReturningHard": DebugQA.apply(.trialExpiredNewUserReturning).
shot paywall-trial-ended-hard
# Not dismissible on purpose: terms .hardPaywall -> showsClose: false,
# allowsInteractiveDismiss: false (HonestPaywallStoryFactory.swift
# chrome(for:); HonestPaywallScreen.swift:55
# .interactiveDismissDisabled(!chrome.allowsInteractiveDismiss)). No Close
# tap here — the only exits are Restore/purchase, which this skill never
# taps. A later flow's own `launch` starts over instead of leaving this
# screen.
